|\\n\\nRotten Tomatoes Critic Score |\\n\\nRotten Tomatoes Audience Score |\\n\\n|\\n\\nThe Walking Dead (2010–2022) |\\n\\n79% |\\n\\n78% |\\n\\n3 Grey's Anatomy (2005 ... \",\"title\":\"https://screenrant.com/tv-shows-ruled-world-airing-list/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d30\"},\"ref\":\"d30\",\"snippet\":\" ... MIKE HALE\\n\\nStream on Amazon.\\n\\n2005-present\\n\\nGrey's Anatomy\\n\\nBecause we all need our \\\"person.\\\"\\n\\nMore tears have been shed over \\\"Grey's Anatomy\\\" than any other prime time drama. It's been on longer than almost anything else, and it's also embraced tragedy, plucked heartstrings ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.nytimes.com/interactive/2019/arts/television/best-drama-series.html\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d31\"},\"ref\":\"d31\",\"snippet\":\" ... They married in 2014 and now share two children.\\n\\nPatrick Dempsey and Jillian Fink\\n\\nThe Grey's Anatomy star found his match at Fink's salon, Delux, in 1994. When the hairstylist noticed there was an appointment under the name \\\"Patrick Dempsey,\\\" she wrote it off as a ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.vogue.com/article/celebrities-married-to-normal-people\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d32\"},\"ref\":\"d32\",\"snippet\":\" ... Grey's Anatomy (2005–14)\\n\\nFrom 2005 to 2014, Oh played Dr. Cristina Yang in the ABC medical drama series Grey's Anatomy. Oh's portrayal of the pragmatic, ambitious Yang earned her five Primetime Emmy nominations for Best Supporting Actress in a Drama Series. She was one ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.thecanadianencyclopedia.ca/en/article/sandra-oh\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"na