 for Best Picture, among others. He also co-starred in the #1 independent film of ... \",\"title\":\"https://m.imdb.com/search/name/?birth_year=1936&ref_=nmbio_bth_yr\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d54\"},\"ref\":\"d54\",\"snippet\":\" ... Personal life\\n\\nAstin has five children; three (David, Allen, and Ashley) with his first wife, Suzanne Hahn, and two with his second wife, actress Patty Duke – one adopted (Sean, Patty's son from an earlier relationship, whom Astin adopted during their marriage) and one biological (Mackenzie).\\n\\nAstin married ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/John_Astin\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d55\"},\"ref\":\"d55\",\"snippet\":\" ... His wife and three children survive him, as do three grandchildren.- Actor\\n\\n- Soundtrack\\n\\nHenry Gibson was born on 21 September 1935 in Germantown, Pennsylvania. Before appearing in films and television series, he was a child star on the stage during the 1940s and during the late 1950s he ... \",\"title\":\"https://m.imdb.com/search/name/?death_date=2009&ref_=nm_ov_dth_year\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"ca719eed2505ab3b4f79ae506f9ccd42a18d33b4a501324aa5c9468867224555\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"8e3094a40d53cef7b36654edc94d037dbe925c2e838da0a5de795af4dc719434\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"character married three times only one child survives series real life relative co-star\",\"view\":\"full\"},{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],